          "partial_json": "{\"subagent_type\": \"discovery-agent\", \"description\": \"You are the Discovery Agent for the BlogMaster AI project documentation.\\n\\nYour task is to:\\n1. Extract the project identifier \\\"BlogMaster AI\\\" from the user request\\n2. Use MCP tools (General_* and Studio_*) to discover all repositories related to BlogMaster AI\\n3. List all available repositories and their basic information (names, descriptions, structures)\\n4. Create a comprehensive discovery catalog\\n\\nSave all your findings to a file called \\\"discovery_catalog.json\\\" with this structure:\\n{\\n  \\\"project_name\\\": \\\"BlogMaster AI\\\",\\n  \\\"discovery_date\\\": \\\"ISO timestamp\\\",\\n  \\\"repositories\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"repo name\\\",\\n      \\\"description\\\": \\\"repo description\\\",\\n      \\\"key_technologies\\\": [],\\n      \\\"file_structure_overview\\\": \\\"brief overview\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"summary\\\": \\\"brief summary of what was discovered\\\"\\n}\\n\\nThis is an autonomous discovery phase - you should not interact with the user. Just discover and document everything you find about the BlogMaster AI project.\"}"
