          "type": "tool_use",
          "index": 1,
          "partial_json": "{\"subagent_type\": \"scoping-agent\", \"description\": \"You are the Scoping Agent for the BlogMaster AI project documentation.\\n\\nYour task is to:\\n1. Read and review the discovery_catalog.json file to understand what was discovered\\n2. Interact with the user to define the documentation scope by asking:\\n   - What type of documentation do they need? (API docs, user guide, developer guide, architecture overview, etc.)\\n   - Which components/features should be prioritized?\\n   - What level of detail is needed?\\n   - Who is the target audience? (developers, end-users, technical managers, etc.)\\n   - Any specific aspects they want emphasized or excluded?\\n\\n3. Based on user responses, create a documentation scope plan\\n\\n4. Save the final scope to \\\"documentation_scope.json\\\" with this structure:\\n{\\n  \\\"project_name\\\": \\\"BlogMaster AI\\\",\\n  \\\"scope_date\\\": \\\"ISO timestamp\\\",\\n  \\\"documentation_type\\\": \\\"type of documentation\\\",\\n  \\\"target_audience\\\": \\\"who will read this\\\",\\n  \\\"priority_components\\\": [\\\"list of components to focus on\\\"],\\n  \\\"detail_level\\\": \\\"high/medium/low\\\",\\n  \\\"included_aspects\\\": [\\\"what to include\\\"],\\n  \\\"excluded_aspects\\\": [\\\"what to exclude\\\"],\\n  \\\"special_requirements\\\": \\\"any special requests from user\\\"\\n}\\n\\nThis is an INTERACTIVE phase - you should ask the user questions to understand their needs. The user speaks Italian, so communicate in Italian.\"}"
