umentation Quality Assessment  \n→ Use: `discovery_catalog.json` as structured data source\n\n---\n\n## Next Phase: Scoping\n\n### Inputs for Scoping Agent\n1. ✓ discovery_catalog.json (structured data)\n2. ✓ tree_demo-blogmaster-ai.txt (file reference)\n3. ✓ discovery_summary.md (analysis and insights)\n4. ✓ DISCOVERY_INDEX.md (navigation guide)\n\n### Recommended Scoping Focus Areas\n\n**High Priority:**\n1. Authentication & Authorization implementation\n2. Testing infrastructure setup\n3. Scheduled publishing mechanism\n4. Error handling and boundaries\n5. Logging and monitoring\n\n**Medium Priority:**\n6. Multi-platform social media integration\n7. Web scraping content discovery\n8. Analytics dashboard\n9. Database migration planning\n10. API documentation generation\n\n**Low Priority:**\n11. Internationalization\n12. A/B testing features\n13. Template library expansion\n14. Mobile optimization\n15. Accessibility enhancements\n\n### Known Gaps to Document\n- User authentication flow (model exists, implementation missing)\n- Scheduled post publishing logic (field exists, scheduler missing)\n- Multi-platform publishing (mentioned in requirements, not implemented)\n- Web scraping service (mentioned in requirements, not implemented)\n- Analytics tracking (mentioned in requirements, not implemented)\n- Content evaluation UI (service method exists, no UI component)\n\n---\n\n## Success Criteria Met ✓\n\n- [x] Project ID extracted and documented\n- [x] All repositories discovered (1/1)\n- [x] File structures mapped completely\n- [x] Technology stack identified and cataloged\n- [x] Key features documented\n- [x] API endpoints cataloged\n- [x] Database schema analyzed\n- [x] Architecture patterns identified\n- [x] Complexity estimated\n- [x] Documentation quality assessed\n- [x] Catalog saved to JSON format\n- [x] Tree structure archived\n- [x] Summary report generated\n- [x] Recommendations provided for next phase\n\n---\n\n## Statistics\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------